I reviewed `src/index.ts` and found the relevant logic at lines 82-90. The function uses `handlers.splice(handlers.indexOf(handler), 1)` to remove a handler. If the `handler` is not present, `handlers.indexOf(handler)` returns `-1`, and `splice(-1, 1)` behavior is likely an unintended side-effect, possibly removing the last element.

I will modify the code to explicitly check if `handler` is found in the `handlers` array before attempting removal.

